      "comment": "Lewis &amp; Short gives <span lang=\"la\">īnfēlīciter</span> only as “unhappily, unfortunately”, of things that turn out badly (<span lang=\"la\">fit mihi obviam īnfēlīciter</span>, Ter. Eun. 2.3.36), never of health. Say <span lang=\"la\">Mē male habeō</span> or <span lang=\"la\">Minus valeō</span>."
